WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.781 --> 00:00:08.320
Hi!

00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:09.195
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.359 --> 00:00:10.875
Welcome to &lt;i&gt;What to Say&lt;/i&gt;!

00:00:31.793 --> 00:00:34.933
Do you know what to say when you want to show interest?

00:00:35.106 --> 00:00:38.738
Listen out for useful language for showing interest.

00:00:39.051 --> 00:00:41.822
Then, we'll practise saying the new phrases –

00:00:41.923 --> 00:00:43.369
after this.

00:00:45.751 --> 00:00:46.883
Morning, Bob.

00:00:47.016 --> 00:00:48.150
Ah, good morning.

00:00:49.095 --> 00:00:51.227
It's so rainy today.

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:54.931
The weather in this country is horrible!

00:00:55.048 --> 00:00:56.048
Yes ...

00:00:56.158 --> 00:00:57.158
yes ...

00:00:59.548 --> 00:01:02.882
The weather was even worse when I lived in Canada.

00:01:03.151 --> 00:01:06.872
Oh, I didn't know that you lived in Canada, Bob.

00:01:06.993 --> 00:01:07.993
How cool!

00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:09.563
One winter

00:01:09.884 --> 00:01:12.227
it was so cold and windy

00:01:12.329 --> 00:01:14.165
that I fell on the ice

00:01:14.189 --> 00:01:16.399
and broke my leg in three places.

00:01:16.503 --> 00:01:18.720
Oh no! You're joking!

00:01:18.814 --> 00:01:20.281
I wish I was, Noelia,

00:01:20.369 --> 00:01:22.204
I wish I was.

00:01:23.415 --> 00:01:25.797
I was never the same after that winter.

00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:28.493
And my leg is still bad today.

00:01:28.509 --> 00:01:29.297
Really?

00:01:29.642 --> 00:01:31.446
I'm sorry to hear that.

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:32.766
Poor you.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:34.713
But it's not all bad.

00:01:35.433 --> 00:01:37.784
I met my wife in the hospital.

00:01:37.846 --> 00:01:40.537
She was the doctor who looked at my leg!

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.932
No way!

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.034
It was love at first sight!

00:01:44.331 --> 00:01:46.073
Ah, that's brilliant!

00:01:46.486 --> 00:01:50.563
Yes, and we're still in love 40 years later ...

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:51.977
So in the end,

00:01:52.071 --> 00:01:55.477
breaking your leg was the best thing that could have happened.

00:01:55.556 --> 00:01:56.556
Yes,

00:01:56.579 --> 00:01:58.579
I suppose it was!

00:02:01.311 --> 00:02:02.311
Hello again!

00:02:02.741 --> 00:02:05.694
Aww, I love a story with a happy ending!

00:02:06.272 --> 00:02:11.170
